{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"asm","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Assembly","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Assembly (.asm .s .S .nasm).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"asm","name":"Assembly","extensions":[".asm",".s",".S",".nasm",".masm"],"grammar":"grammars/asm.json","lineComment":";"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Assembly","path":"snippets/asm.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/asm.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": true,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \";.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*[A-Za-z_.$][A-Za-z0-9_.$]*:\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\.[a-z]+\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[0-9][0-9A-Fa-f]*[hH]\\\\b|\\\\$[0-9A-Fa-f]+\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:syscall|section|segment|global|extern|leave|enter|movsb|movsw|movsd|stosb|lodsb|times|push|imul|idiv|test|call|loop|xchg|cmov|resb|resw|resd|resq|bits|mov|pop|lea|add|sub|mul|div|inc|dec|and|xor|not|neg|shl|shr|sar|rol|ror|cmp|jmp|jne|jnz|jge|jle|jae|jbe|ret|int|nop|cld|std|rep|adc|sbb|cdq|cqo|equ|org|or|je|jz|jg|jl|ja|jb|db|dw|dd|dq)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:rax|rbx|rcx|rdx|rsi|rdi|rbp|rsp|rip|r10|r11|r12|r13|r14|r15|eax|ebx|ecx|edx|esi|edi|ebp|esp|r8|r9|ax|bx|cx|dx|al|bl|cl|dl|ah|bh|ch|dh|x0|x1|x2|sp|lr|pc)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:dword|qword|byte|word|ptr)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/asm.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Section text\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"text\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"section .text\",\n      \"global _start\",\n      \"\",\n      \"_start:\",\n      \"\\t$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"The code section\"\n  },\n  \"Exit syscall\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"exit\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"mov rax, 60\",\n      \"xor rdi, rdi\",\n      \"syscall\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Linux exit(0)\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:name}:\",\n      \"\\tpush rbp\",\n      \"\\tmov rbp, rsp\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"\\tpop rbp\",\n      \"\\tret\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function with a frame\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Assembly\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Assembly.\n\n## Files\n\n`.asm`, `.s`, `.S`, `.nasm`, `.masm`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `;`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `text` | The code section |\n| `exit` | Linux exit(0) |\n| `fn` | A function with a frame |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}